sequenceDiagram
    participant G as HubGalleryTab / HubForensicsTab
    participant R as TextPreviewRenderer
    participant L as OneTextLabel (hidden)
    participant C as Camera (hidden, disabled)
    participant A as AtlasFlushScheduler

    G->>R: Render(text, font, language, size, width, height, wrap, alignment)
    R->>R: EnsureScene(width, height): Camera + RenderTexture + Canvas (ScreenSpaceCamera) + label, all HideAndDontSave
    R->>L: Font, Text, FontSize, Wrap, Alignment, Overflow=Overflow, Language, Kinsoku, color
    alt label.Font is null
        R-->>G: null (no font to draw with)
    end
    R->>L: rectTransform.sizeDelta = (width, height)
    R->>R: Canvas.ForceUpdateCanvases()
    R->>A: FlushNow() (upload tiles baked during this repaint)
    R->>C: Render() into the RenderTexture
    R->>R: ReadPixels into a new Texture2D (HideAndDontSave)
    R-->>G: Texture2D (caller owns it)
    G->>G: cache by key - DestroyImmediate on ClearPreviews / Dispose
